  "content": "<h3><em><strong>巴西製造</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4c5f477e1655471df04174516f88081286146a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></em></h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/665f041a8a2b95b22f8a57282e1e36f1543ee9a0_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1706\" height=\"700\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RE6JVPMFpV\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/88ded17ec723eff80f6785bbeda38e3c47584c48.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dYE3TNTVNFFKXL%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dBy%2bbeing%2ba%2bdonor%252c%2byou%2bcontribute%2bto%2bthe%2bcreation%2bof%2bmy%2bMinecraft%2bcontent.%2526currency_code%253dBRL\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab71d7575902b145c54f6027017d09930124d1d7.png\" alt=\"PayPal 捐款\" width=\"\" height=\"\"> </a></p><h2><strong>關於</strong></h2><p>撲翼機滑翔翼是一款自訂滑翔翼模組，為飛行帶來全新的體驗。靈感來自達文西的飛行器，這對精心打造的翅膀讓你能以自訂動畫、音效，以及完整的 Curios 背部欄位支援，在遊戲世界中翱翔。</p><p>無論是探索廣闊的地景，還是深入險境，撲翼機都能讓每次飛行都充滿史詩般的感受。</p><h2><strong>預覽</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcXppMHAxMW05MjdpeHVmZDR4cG55MXB4ZDhpdDNlMGZvc3psOWcxOCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/7Mt4GmaLtJyyVpbXl5/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"218\"></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:559px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EBTCV4SWYAk?start=718&amp;hl=zh-TW&amp;cc_lang_pref=zh-TW&amp;cc_load_policy=1\" width=\"559\" height=\"325\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h2><strong>使用方法</strong></h2><p>按下指定按鍵（預設為空白鍵）可累積能量條，然後「拍動翅膀」產生推進力。此推進力有 2 秒的冷卻時間。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e28a2ff0805e5bbdde15efadf76b908719d1c7b8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"169\"></p><h2><strong>合成方式</strong></h2><p>撲翼機滑翔翼只能使用 Create 模組的機械合成台進行合成。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e702784c480242452853f53948adad2835e62d8c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"129\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a64f4dbb1c0a39aa4cca3c98f643b04f491f6f14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"301\"></p><h2><strong>必要依賴</strong></h2><p>此模組需要其他幾個模組才能正常運作。請確保已安裝以下模組以獲得完整功能：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">⚙️ Create</a></li>\n</ul><h2><strong>可選依賴</strong></h2><p>以下模組完全相容：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">✨ Curios API</a> 或（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🎩 Accessories</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories-cc-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios 相容層</a>）</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>搭配建議</strong></h2><p>此模組若與以下模組搭配使用，效果更佳：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/distant-horizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🌍 遠方地平線</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/do-a-barrel-roll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🛢️ 來個桶滾</a></li>\n</ul>",
